      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/VortixWx/status/2000316917744021620",
      "text": "#WxHistory |\nTyphoon Melor '15 (Nona; originally named Nonoy but changed retroactively due to political reasons) was tracking through the Philippines as a major typhoon. Melor brought destructive winds to Luzon mainly & very heavy rainfall that led to deadly flooding. \n\nOriental Mindoro suffered the worse where many buildings were destroyed, leading to many being homeless. In Metro Manila, travel was greatly affected & many areas had water rising well over 1m. \n\nMelor killed 51 in total & both that name, plus the PAGASA name Nona got booted & were replaced with Cempaka & Nimfa respectively.",
